  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "海膽"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>阿熒</b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b><br /></b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgf16qJH22MUtZrqOnHRh3cjn4iY8_I9PNlE6b-l9yRG_AWqDhsZQ1deiHbfoyvPxm3htG4YjJlX3ES5husQdBA4LoIxjow8ADL68kg3Epe_kbzrGOiHX5Y01kaiWrP3i7z2NFPy1uAPyndIqZlIf76_sI-ZaRgXlt0jKLUmxG0W0nDTxQ3gSYaoEuWWQ/s800/%E6%B5%B7%E8%86%BD-1.jpeg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"600\" data-original-width=\"800\" height=\"480\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgf16qJH22MUtZrqOnHRh3cjn4iY8_I9PNlE6b-l9yRG_AWqDhsZQ1deiHbfoyvPxm3htG4YjJlX3ES5husQdBA4LoIxjow8ADL68kg3Epe_kbzrGOiHX5Y01kaiWrP3i7z2NFPy1uAPyndIqZlIf76_sI-ZaRgXlt0jKLUmxG0W0nDTxQ3gSYaoEuWWQ/w640-h480/%E6%B5%B7%E8%86%BD-1.jpeg\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><br /><br /><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">熱天若到，去澎湖tshit-thô kap食海產絕對是hōo人感覺tsiok幸福ê一項代誌，尤其是新曆6～8--月hit當時ê海膽（hái-tánn）甜koh好食，kan-na聽--著就hōo人喙瀾tsha̍p-tsha̍p滴。海膽好食bóng好食，suah kánn-ná無想過伊是啥mih貨？Lán食--ê koh是海膽ê啥mih所在？Tsit-má就來介紹tsit種ná像真熟sāi koh真生份ê生物--őo！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">海膽是一種動物，規身軀hōo tīng-tīng ê殼包--leh，殼頂kuân有tsha̍k-tsha̍k ê刺。Hia-ê刺是uì殼面頂phok--出-來ê構造生--出-來--ê ，若是kā刺剝--起-來，就ē看著kah海星、海參仝款phok-phok ê皮膚。就是án-ne生，科學家tsiah kā in lóng分tī棘皮（kik-phuê，皮phok-phok ê意思）動物內底。Kah人仝款，in mā有uì喙到糞口ê消化系統，m̄-koh in ê喙是tī下跤、糞口tī頂kuân，拄仔好kah人顛倒píng！海膽mā有分食肉、食菜kah lóng食ê種類：食肉--ê ē食khah細隻ê動物，食菜--ê就是食海草類，lóng食--ê當然就是拄著啥mi̍h食啥mi̍h--looh。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgYzXUM7bKQObqHBNAZ9sKs1ozTDbBAvXOy4WTQNfE60TZoPnpDbMwKFqi-CXYbNQrpXcbjFngCVmiEPQB0D-iLyBjC2zEOL3VCfug6XFtaepj2ef36xkYRa3dz1cqPm-S6jB1Lzb5dUzQ_6R-11VA4aUtOms8vt1mMsFaJwMOBwrl6KgVZx0LJ4msXUQ/s1024/%E6%B5%B7%E8%86%BD%E7%9A%84%E7%94%9F%E6%AE%96%E4%BD%AE%E6%B6%88%E5%8C%96%E7%B3%BB%E7%B5%B1.png\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"768\" data-original-width=\"1024\" height=\"480\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgYzXUM7bKQObqHBNAZ9sKs1ozTDbBAvXOy4WTQNfE60TZoPnpDbMwKFqi-CXYbNQrpXcbjFngCVmiEPQB0D-iLyBjC2zEOL3VCfug6XFtaepj2ef36xkYRa3dz1cqPm-S6jB1Lzb5dUzQ_6R-11VA4aUtOms8vt1mMsFaJwMOBwrl6KgVZx0LJ4msXUQ/w640-h480/%E6%B5%B7%E8%86%BD%E7%9A%84%E7%94%9F%E6%AE%96%E4%BD%AE%E6%B6%88%E5%8C%96%E7%B3%BB%E7%B5%B1.png\" width=\"640\" /></span></a></div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span><br /></span></p>大部份ê海膽有分公--ê kah母--ê ，in ê精子iah是卵子成熟了後就ē放去海內底受精。Tann仔pū--出-來ê海膽kah人仝款是兩爿對thīn--ê ，一直到beh tńg大人ê時tsūn就變做kah海星仝款tuì中ng放射--出-去ê五放射對thīn。到tann科學家猶原m̄知影為啥mı̍h ē有tsit款變化，kan-na ē-tàng講是大自然ê奧妙--lah！</span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一般lán看--著ê海膽lóng已經hông破--開、真oh看著五放射對thīn，若是ē-hiáu藏水bī，一寡珊瑚礁附近其實lóng揣ē著in ê形影thang好看，m̄-koh有ê海膽是有毒--ê ，bē-hiáu認種類又koh無細膩去hōo伊tsha̍k--著就費氣--ah。Beh看著放射對thīn上好ê辦法就是看化石。台灣真濟所在lóng ē-sái看著海膽化石，比論基隆、台北、苗栗、台中等等ê所在lóng揣ē著，m̄-nā ē用得斟酌看koh bē tio̍h傷，ē-tàng kā in對thīn ê形體看hōo清。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">啊lán leh食--ê到底是海膽ê啥mih所在？其實是in ê生殖腺，也就是成熟iáu未放去海內底ê精巢、卵巢--ōo！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiy9V-FrfYSp5vJGduZVItp39ndqbMD78gn3U_-s78keMtUesXSWj3ZAlxDaLSu0nQiktl2wkGS7z3u-fnNtY4GrsKLshuKSPldoa0nGovGyhev9SYf3D__6BpLCfz-zipBNjy3zJKmXMTJmG04iieOGMsy323l3sVdOP4zcwFaOqbUzVr26mh5cGguNQ/s800/%E6%B5%B7%E8%86%BD-2.jpeg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"600\" data-original-width=\"800\" height=\"480\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiy9V-FrfYSp5vJGduZVItp39ndqbMD78gn3U_-s78keMtUesXSWj3ZAlxDaLSu0nQiktl2wkGS7z3u-fnNtY4GrsKLshuKSPldoa0nGovGyhev9SYf3D__6BpLCfz-zipBNjy3zJKmXMTJmG04iieOGMsy323l3sVdOP4zcwFaOqbUzVr26mh5cGguNQ/w640-h480/%E6%B5%B7%E8%86%BD-2.jpeg\" width=\"640\" /></a></span></div><p></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div><br /></div><p></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div><b><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">阿熒ê教室</span>&nbsp;</b><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/Guaayingla\" target=\"_blank\"><b>https://www.facebook.com/Guaayingla</b></a></div><div><b>「身軀ê科學」課程報名 <a href=\"https://forms.gle/FwgkxsViJg1iQz1K8\" target=\"_blank\">https://forms.gle/FwgkxsViJg1iQz1K8</a></b></div><div><b>「生活中ê科學」課程報名 <a href=\"https://forms.gle/cngCHcga2ZrxhFJt9\" target=\"_blank\">https://forms.gle/cngCHcga2ZrxhFJt9</a></b></div></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span></div><span><!--more--></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi7frCeXv4T5DZNAiwIDvXSRu4xXYtneCudDFsSo1O5oN9pEH37mYDQy3v6za31x5BRmQz_9kyf1B-H3tE3dY4B-AGSq-